    "chunk_text": "an wyl marubian on w\u00e6tre godne d\u00e6l, geswet hwon, sele drincan scenc ful. Eft, marubian, swi\u00f0e wyl on hunige, do hwon buteran on, sele III sn\u00e6da o\u00fe\u00fee IIII etan, on neaht Wi\u00fe \u00feon \u00fee mon blode hr\u00e6ce & spiwe genim god beren mela & hwit sealt, do on ream o\u00fe\u00fee gode Wi\u00fe seondum geallan ete r\u00e6dic & pipor on neaht nestig & awylled lins\u00e6d on meolce supe mid, do Him bi\u00fe sona sel. Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle sio cym\u00f0 of seondum geallan genim \u00fe\u00e6s scearpan \u00feistles moran & Him bi\u00fe sona sel. Wyrc godne dustdrenc wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re geolwan adle, nim merces s\u00e6d & finoles s\u00e6d, dile s\u00e6d, He is god wi\u00fe \u00e6lcre liman untrumnesse & wi\u00fe heafodece & wi\u00fe ungemynde & wi\u00fe eagw\u00e6rce & Gewyrc \u00fee dust genoh on h\u00e6rfeste, \u00feonne \u00feu \u00fea wyrta h\u00e6bbe nytta \u00feonne \u00fee \u00feearf sie. Wi\u00f0 breostw\u00e6rce, marubie, nefte, ontre, bisceopwyrt, wenwyrt, wyl on hunige & buteran, do \u00fe\u00e6s Wi\u00fe hwostan & lungenadle genim swegles \u00e6ppel & swefl & recels, ealra emfela, meng wi\u00fe weaxe, Wi\u00fe lungenadle genim betonican & marubian, agrimonian, wermod, felterre, rude, acrind, gagollan, Wyrc briw wi\u00fe lungenadle, nim betonican & marubian, wermod, hindheolo\u00fean, wenwyrt Eft, wyl on hunige",
